  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞２楼　节目走廊\n　“兴奋畅玩乐园”前……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_141.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞伙伴们聚在一起……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_141.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E7 02}说起来，那个祭典迷宫\n是不是特别热啊？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_141.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}啊，你也这么觉得？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_141.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 DE 04}嗯，温度和湿度似乎都很高。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_141.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}而且，热量好像是\n从下面的楼层传上来的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_141.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D5 0C}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}那不就意味着，\n接下来只会越来越热吗……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_141.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 09 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}是错觉吗……比起单纯的炎热，\n我更觉得那像是一种活力……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_141.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}也许吧。\n像是热气……闷得让人受不了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_141.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}活力……热气……闷得难受……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_141.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A7 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}怎、怎么感觉……\n不好的回忆又涌上来了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_141.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 76 11}什么回忆啊？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_141.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 11 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2A 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}就是你啊！\n当然是你的桑拿房啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_141.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
