  "message_id": "MSG_028",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞和伙伴们度过了一段愉快的时光……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
